GRAMMAR.md §7.1 (DECISIONS 380): tiers {} declares no tier, so an "upward" import and an unlisted package give nothing.
-- project.canon --
project acme {
  canon: "0.1"
  tiers {}
}
-- a/a.canon --
package a
-- a/vocab/vocab.canon --
package a.vocab

import a
